    "html": "<p>The gravitational potential energy of a space telescope orbiting a planet at a distance <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"R\"></span> from the surface of the planet is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"E\"></span> and the weight of the space telescope is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"W\"></span>. The radius of the planet is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"R\"></span>. What are the gravitational potential energy and the weight of the satellite at the surface of the planet?</p>\n\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Gravitational potential energy</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Weight</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"A\">\n<td><strong>A.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2E\"></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2W\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"B\">\n<td><strong>B.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2E\"></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4W\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"C\">\n<td><strong>C.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4E\"></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2W\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"D\">\n<td><strong>D.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4E\"></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4W\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
